{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We are in the same boat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigating on the rivers that change every week can be difficult. Surviving is even more challenging. Work as a team to survive and catch the biggest, rarest fishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/c3c92d965569cb44c8b94c741c94759b.poster.avif?t=1758217105\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/c3c92d965569cb44c8b94c741c94759b.webm?t=1758217105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/c3c92d965569cb44c8b94c741c94759b.mp4?t=1758217105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surviving on the Water</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you will need food, warmth and other resources you can catch from the water. Your stamina will be your limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/08bb7efe49bbf6cfadd9e716072af341.poster.avif?t=1758217105\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/08bb7efe49bbf6cfadd9e716072af341.webm?t=1758217105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/08bb7efe49bbf6cfadd9e716072af341.mp4?t=1758217105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Night, Dark Waters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving the dangers is definitely harder at night, when resources are tight, batteries run out and someone is out there to catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/4d0e4014b971d7108449dac34fbeeb14.poster.avif?t=1758217105\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/4d0e4014b971d7108449dac34fbeeb14.webm?t=1758217105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/4d0e4014b971d7108449dac34fbeeb14.mp4?t=1758217105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creaky Shores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a drink and take a break before you get going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/b6c8d3c57331a480c150a3cb11fec65c.poster.avif?t=1758217105\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/b6c8d3c57331a480c150a3cb11fec65c.webm?t=1758217105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/extras/b6c8d3c57331a480c150a3cb11fec65c.mp4?t=1758217105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007710?t=1758217105","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/d2a230ae363d748dbc35446bd1c1178f72eb5423/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758217105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007710/3a2c15c3dc2886f3e6c3baa47ace96087aad1465/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758217105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor